{"availability":"available","full":"bunlongheng/flows","name":"flows","description":"Interactive AWS/GCP architecture diagram tool (React Flow) with a secure, AI-callable render-only artifact API.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-23T10:30:13Z","updated":"2026-10-18T14:31:06Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://flows-bheng.vercel.app","topics":["api","architecture","aws","diagrams","jira","postgresql","react","react-flow","reactflow","system-design","vercel","vite"],"demo":"https://flows-bheng.vercel.app/demo","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T15:42:53.475Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T15:42:53.475Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T15:42:53.475Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:03.977Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:20:28.605Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T04:26:57.670Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T07:59:43.663Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T15:42:53.475Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["AWS and GCP architecture diagrams an agent can draw and a README can embed.","Describe a system, get a React Flow canvas back: 118 real services with real logos, laid out for you, with per-node notes and numbered steps you can walk a room through. Every diagram is a row in Postgres, and the same row renders back out as JSON, a self-contained SVG or an animated GIF from a plain URL - so the picture in your docs is the diagram, not a screenshot of one that drifted 3 commits ago. An id that resolves to no logo is rejected at create time, which is why a diagram a model made looks like one a person made.","Live: flows-bheng.vercel.app &middot; Demo wall: /demo"],"features":["118 real logos - a node whose id has no logo is refused, so a diagram never shows a lettered box.","Or bring your own - an https or data: icon is fetched once and stored inside the diagram.","Or a picture - a node can carry a screenshot or photo (image: file path, https, base64, or an AirClips clip), shown at 4:3 inside the card and in every export.","It places itself - leave x/y out and the server lays the nodes out before it saves them.","A diagram is a URL - the same row as JSON, SVG or animated GIF. New ones are private until you publish."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bunlongheng/flows/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"79bb013f6cef754d756fe70fb1d53aed573e37f61790fa02f98de11853c77865","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:43.781Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:43.781Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"AWS and GCP architecture diagrams an agent can draw and a README can embed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bunlongheng/flows/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"79bb013f6cef754d756fe70fb1d53aed573e37f61790fa02f98de11853c77865","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bunlongheng/flows/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:43.781Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T14:48:49Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bunlongheng/flows/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:43.781Z","hash":"79bb013f6cef754d756fe70fb1d53aed573e37f61790fa02f98de11853c77865","originalBytes":10650,"storedBytes":10650,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:43.663Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Design","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["MCP servers & agents"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://flows-bheng.vercel.app/demo","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T16:05:54.406Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T16:05:54.406Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-18T16:05:54.406Z","target":"https://flows-bheng.vercel.app/demo","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-